<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ import orders trend falls in July - SNZ.</title>
<headline>NZ import orders trend falls in July - SNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The trend in non-fuel import orders in July fell by 2.0 percent from the previous month, Statistics New Zealand said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The trend has been falling since January, SNZ said.  </p>
<p>The capital goods trend remained virtually unchanged from June to July, following an average monthly rise of 1.7 percent from a low point in December 1995.</p>
<p>The trend had rising 3.0 percent from July, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
